NXT-M3 R6 isolated physical mechanisms - specified resistor losses and an ideal input switch
.include models/sic.lib
Cdual dual 0 5.5u IC=195
RdualA dual 0 498k
RdualB dual 0 498k
Csingle single 0 5.5u IC=195
Rsingle single 0 498k
Vdc vin 0 12
Lconnected vin path1 150u Rser=.16
D1 path1 passive STPSC4H065D
R1 passive 0 1k
Vopen enable 0 0
Soff vin path2 enable 0 openinput
.model openinput SW(Ron=.2 Roff=100Meg Vt=.5)
Lisolated path2 path3 150u Rser=.16
D2 path3 isolated STPSC4H065D
R2 isolated 0 1k
.tran 0 4 0 1m uic
.options numdgt=6
.save V(dual) V(single) V(passive) V(isolated)
.meas tran DUAL_60 WHEN V(dual)=60 FALL=1
.meas tran SINGLE_60 WHEN V(single)=60 FALL=1
.meas tran PASSIVE_NOW FIND V(passive) AT 10m
.meas tran ISOLATED_NOW FIND V(isolated) AT 10m
.meas tran HV_END FIND V(single) AT 4
.end
